# Local Claude Code overrides (the skills in .claude/skills/ ARE committed)
.claude/settings.local.json

# The Homebrew formula is generated, and the tap it is published to is the only
# copy anyone installs from. release.yml's `tap` job regenerates it in CI and
# pushes it to tiredithumans/homebrew-tap, never back here, so a committed copy
# only ever went stale: it still named v0.5.1 after v0.5.2 was published.
# `just homebrew-formula` writes it here for inspection.
/packaging/homebrew/crt-query.rb

